{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand years of longing, one thousand livers devoured\u2014<br>yet instead of ascending as an immortal, the nine-tailed fox <strong>Kim Samwol</strong> awakens as a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting into the modern city, she is rescued by caf\u00e9 owner Park Jongman and begins working at his small caf\u00e9. But when she discovers that Jongman is destined with the \u201cKing\u2019s Fortune,\u201d she must choose:<br>Devour his life to become immortal, or fall in love and embrace her fragile humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Fantasy Romance Visual Novel</strong> \u2013 A mystical love story between a human and a nine-tailed fox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a <strong>Fully Voiced Characters</strong> \u2013 Every character, except the protagonist, is fully voiced to bring emotions alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Beautiful Spine Animations</strong> \u2013 Characters are brought to life with smooth animations beyond static 2D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Immersive Original OST</strong> \u2013 Music directed by Shin Jun-ki (BUZZ), with multiple original soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Interactive Mini-games</strong> \u2013 Serve customers in a deduction-style caf\u00e9 minigame where dialogue hints at their drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Choose between the path of immortality, humanity, or fading into nothingness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCoffee Fox: Kim Samwol\u201d is a story-rich visual novel that blends <strong>Korean mythology, romance, and modern life</strong> into an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/1a0e9f4a8f7b4263443a301ac539051b.avif?t=1762362358\" width=1560 height=1224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/d763891b08feee227fda1c3fd9134c6b.avif?t=1762362358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras_big/d763891b08feee227fda1c3fd9134c6b.avif?t=1762362358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/c7cb70f90275a935bb318497fa91cb3d.avif?t=1762362358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras_big/c7cb70f90275a935bb318497fa91cb3d.avif?t=1762362358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/009f1a5467636c95465843d4d0306bd9.avif?t=1762362358\" width=1560 height=1198 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/b7e1e660bb2abfad8ba7ddf42a325d7a.avif?t=1762362358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras_big/b7e1e660bb2abfad8ba7ddf42a325d7a.avif?t=1762362358 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras/cb8903199bfb7d1e0e1badb5988f6441.avif?t=1762362358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059600/extras_big/cb8903199bfb7d1e0e1badb59